        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kilou Yosua ŋirwosi ŋulu ewasiyete alo Kuju",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani iirari erwosit Yabin ŋolo ka Asor ŋakiro ŋun, kiyakiya ŋituŋa neni a Yobab a erwosit a Madon ka neni a ŋolo a Simiron ta neni a ŋolo ka Akisap. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiyakiya nabo ŋituŋa neni a ŋirwosi a ŋulu aya nakwap ŋina a ŋikamukumukui ŋina alowae a ŋolo alo Kuju ka neni a ŋulu aya Araba nadipo ŋina alo Kwap anam Galileya ka neni a ŋulu anadipo a ŋina a ŋikamukumukui a ŋulu a Karimel ta neni a ŋulu nadipo ka anam Mediteranian diyete Dor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiyakiya daŋ ŋituŋa neni a Ŋikanaani a ŋulu alomito Kide ka To aŋolol Yorodan ka neni a Ŋiamori, neni a Ŋiitaiti, neni a Ŋiperisi ka neni a Ŋiyebusi a ŋulu alomito nakwap ŋina a ŋikamukumukui ta Ŋiipi ŋulu alomito nakeju a emoru Erimon nakwap ŋina enyaritae Misipa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋirwosi ŋul potu ka ŋasigarya kec daadaŋ. Alalak ŋasigarya ŋun nooi atya alalau kec asinyon ŋina eyai lokipetot ka anam. Ayakatar daŋ ikes ŋaŋolei ka ŋagaari ŋuna iritae a ŋaŋolei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiryamuryamunos ŋirwosi ŋul daadaŋ neni acamunito ikes akiryamun, tocunakis ŋajorei kec toruwor apei, kiboikinos diyete ŋakipi ŋuna ka ayonae a ŋina enyaritae Merom aŋuna ka akitijiore Ŋisirael.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimok nai Ekapolon Yosua tema, “Nyikibul aŋuna kec, anerae moi taparacu ŋisaae lu peilu, epotokini ayoŋ ikes neni a Ŋisirael tomunyarae. Tosodi nai iyoŋ totubutubu ŋamori ŋuna a ŋakejen a ŋaŋolei, ido kicunyak ŋagaari kec.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai Yosua ka ŋasigarya keŋ daadaŋ kituumikis ŋajorei ŋun kisiiryakis anakipi a Merom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kipotok nai Ekapolon ŋirwosi ŋul ka ŋasigarya kec nakan a Ŋisirael, toarae ikes kiritarae lowae ŋolo alo Kuju, todolo neni enyaritae Sidon ka Misirepoti-Maim, todolo tari Kide nakadipaalat ŋina enyaritae Misipa. Toarae ŋimoe ŋuk nyidoŋ tari ipei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitiyak Yosua neni kec lopite ŋolo alimokinitor Ekapolon iŋes. Totubutubu ŋamori ŋuna a ŋakejen a ŋaŋolei kec, kicunyak ŋagaari kec.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Yosua apaki ŋinapei toboŋo kaku kikama Asor, toar a ekileŋ erwosit keŋ. Arae sek erwosit ka Asor apolokinit neni epukato ŋirwosi ŋul daadaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toara Yosua ka ŋituŋa keŋ ŋituŋa daadaŋ ŋulu aya nen, mam ituŋanan aponi toesikinae eyari. Ani ekaku, kicunyakis etaun Asor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Yosua tomunya ŋitaunio ŋul kaapei ka ŋirwosi kec, toar a ekileŋ ŋituŋa daadaŋ, lopite ŋolo kicikitor Moses ŋolo arae eketiyan a Ekapolon iŋes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai ŋitaunio ŋulu adukitoe loreŋoroto apotu Ŋisirael nyicunyakis, mati Asor bon ŋolo abu Yosua kicunyak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu Ŋisirael taŋatasi ŋiboro daadaŋ ka ŋibaren alotaunio a ŋul. Nai toara ikes a ekileŋ ŋituŋa daadaŋ nyeesikis tari ipei eyari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae epite ŋolopei sek ecikitor Ekapolon Moses eketiyan keŋ, abunio Moses kicikia Yosua, tosodi Yosua kitiyak ŋun. Nyeesikina iŋes akitiya idiobore daadaŋ ŋini ecikit Ekapolon Moses.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kikama Yosua akwap ŋin daadaŋ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kikama Yosua akwap ŋin daadaŋ, akwap ŋina a ŋikamukumukui, ŋadipoe a ŋikamukumukui, Kuju ka Kwap, kikama akwap a Gosen daadaŋ ka aloŋisat ŋina alo Kwap ka Araba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toar Yosua ŋirwosi ŋul daadaŋ ka kikama ŋakwapin kec ŋinapei alomoru Alak a ŋolo idiri Seir akitodol neni enyaritae Baaligad neni a akadipaalat a Lebanon a ŋina anakeju a emoru a ŋolo enyaritae Erimon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ajito Yosua ka ŋirwosi ŋul daadaŋ ŋirwa ŋulu alalak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mam etaun epei daŋ ŋolo apotu ŋituŋa keŋ toruworos ŋipei ka Ŋisirael mati Gibeon bon ŋolo a Ŋiipi. Aponi ŋuluce daadaŋ kilounae alojie, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anerae arae Ekapolon iŋes abu kitogogoŋ ŋakyes kec, ikotere imukekinete akitijiore Ŋisirael, ido tomunyarae jik nyisyoni tari ipei, nai tolemarae jik anakwap lopite ŋolopei ecikitor Ekapolon Moses.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apaki ŋin, abu Yosua tolot kitiji ka toar ŋituŋa ŋulu anyaritae Ŋinakim ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11:21",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ŋinakim",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ikes ŋituŋa ŋululaŋir tooyak",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ŋulu alomito nakwapin ŋuna a ŋikamukumukui nu: Eburon, Debir ka Anab ta nakwapin ŋuna a ŋikamukumukui daadaŋ alo Yudaya ka Isirael. Tomunya jik Yosua ikes ka ŋitaunio kec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mam Ŋianakim tari ipei ŋini abu kidoŋ nakwap a Isirael, nai apotu ŋidikudyo kidoŋo Gasa ka Gat ta Acidod. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Yosua kikama akwap daadaŋ lopite ŋolo ecikitor Ekapolon Moses. Inak Yosua akwap ŋin neni a Ŋisirael toruwor ŋina kec, totyakatyaka, inak ŋolokabila akwap keŋ. Todaun nai ejie, kieŋa akwap ŋin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
